<title>CHINA: NEW ZEALAND TOPS AUSTRALIAN AIR CARGO TRAFFIC LIST.</title>
<headline>NEW ZEALAND TOPS AUSTRALIAN AIR CARGO TRAFFIC LIST.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand followed by the U.S. were the biggest suppliers of Australia's air cargo imports during 1996, statistics published by Australia's Department of Transport and Regional Development show.</p>
<p>Singapore provided the main market for Australia's air cargo exports with New Zealand in second place.</p>
